    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mēlĭnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		Melos, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the island of Melos,
				Melian; subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mēlĭnum</span></b> , i,
			n., <i>a kind of white color, Melian
			white</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pigmentum, or simply Melinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Most. 1, 3, 106</span></i>
			 Lorenz ad loc.; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 6, 17, § 36</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Vitr.
				7, 7, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alumen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 15, 52, § 188</span></i>
			.</div>
